silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_05_cheese_trap_functor_vs_data_dump_sections_02_data_dump_as_master_face_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'DataDumpAsMasterFaceYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the functor F sends Mittens to F(Mittens), giving the central object of the transport diagram its clinic-side image." .
